                <l xml:id="m-ed3665aa-83e7-4bfe-96f4-9ce26ccc7d72" facs="#m-5d1ff830-4fee-4a98-bbad-cb21bbaabc44" label="ambiguous">782</l><l xml:id="m-ed525989-0971-4173-8d90-a9a45164236c" facs="#m-c5548fcd-76dc-417f-94fd-4b8e0f411c84" label="text-like">omice and Mass on Easter day</l><l xml:id="m-cbe923cb-c74d-4a6e-b93d-e31282454ca4" facs="#m-7a086ff1-200e-45c9-a810-ccab9b972abe" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-68e7ab63-09f4-4feb-88c6-0799836a2c0c" facs="#m-8e1e59e6-25ae-489c-96ef-f53879a48411" label="lyrics-like">NPiritum nobis, Dómine, tuae ca¬l cias pietâte concórdes. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-68106cd3-5118-48b8-9f76-6138ad2924be" facs="#m-e39e7e8a-6287-4200-85ba-876711152340" label="lyrics-like">Dritátis infunde: ut, quos sacra- num.</l><l xml:id="m-4e0b50cc-974d-408b-b0f8-90bd24c36640" facs="#m-0cc9a84c-9860-476b-8ec3-7b9f29498922" label="lyrics-like">méntis Paschálibus satiásti, tua fá¬</l><l xml:id="m-006519b5-84e9-4c46-8c39-008ea50674ac" facs="#m-c7466876-7c14-4455-8c2e-bc51f64cf24f" label="text-like">At Sext and None, all is said as at Terce, p. 777.</l><l xml:id="m-7486477a-60e3-4508-a22f-dfc81f52407f" facs="#m-e1986d9c-d766-41b4-ac71-df591e59d5bc" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-02f6c8e3-9b68-4431-8e9c-320b90feb66a" facs="#m-e1865ec6-d601-4aec-8e4a-0205c6b3e8de" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Dixit Dóminus. 8. G. 133.— 2. Confitébor. 7. c. 139.—</l><l xml:id="m-4e4a5e74-0b59-46c8-8873-debe90600771" facs="#m-c83faab1-510b-4b3e-b73d-c997139219b9" label="lyrics-like">3. Béatus vir. 8. c. 147. — 4. Laudáte. púeri. 7. a. 151. — 5. In éxitu.</l><l xml:id="m-60b52f97-031f-49d4-9820-5748d6cf0a53" facs="#m-d20546ac-0136-487f-be97-c7bea602fd4e" label="ambiguous">8. G. 159.</l><l xml:id="m-8b7bb867-02f6-462d-972d-ed90c61a40e8" facs="#m-ce4f0c3d-3cf5-4ea2-8a3b-053cc8c69a4c" label="ambiguous">1. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-73fcbc12-de4e-4dab-ae62-e630183a62c2" facs="#m-9c7cad31-683e-4d33-9b1c-f133d3d160ac" label="ambiguous">8.G</l><l xml:id="m-d4116dc4-cb0a-4def-8bcb-efff9602d200" facs="#m-5b43f798-5ed7-4a89-871d-94edde277496" label="lyrics-like">Nge-lus autem Dó-mini“ descéndit de caé-lo, et</l><l xml:id="m-01848d43-c89e-4b97-b3ad-ed47d1f0dfcb" facs="#m-1254574e-7630-425b-85c8-2203d0eb5b0e" label="lyrics-like">accé-dens revólvit lápidem, et sedébat super é- um, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-440b2ed9-af48-4610-9993-beb24e0e41eb" facs="#m-4c78eb37-7ae8-449c-997e-095c77bcc81b" label="ambiguous">2.Ant.p</l><l xml:id="m-842d4ad5-a9f7-4dd1-a8fa-b955b1a14582" facs="#m-0bfc823e-67de-4dea-b1c6-8b832b55c4e7" label="ambiguous">7. e.</l><l xml:id="m-3ac62be9-436d-4dc3-a43b-b9237b814a33" facs="#m-0bd4bdf6-acd6-462a-82d2-7560ae062248" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia, alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e. VT ecce terraemó¬</l><l xml:id="m-838f2778-17a2-4cfa-b0ba-9e89f6f84e88" facs="#m-74112171-1994-435b-ab71-8bf66467d3be" label="lyrics-like">tus “ fáctus est mágnus: Ange-lus enim Dómi-ni descén¬</l><l xml:id="m-4997b0d1-570b-43f4-bf4d-8f1b2a5ce9f6" facs="#m-e447bdb6-6ae7-49be-85c2-9b3804ec93e3" label="ambiguous">8. e.</l><l xml:id="m-c8249c3e-3da2-4c3e-b8a5-6fcbf9c60f9b" facs="#m-d89b8662-26ff-4477-a944-e8b28b6b4a4f" label="lyrics-like">dit de caélo, alle-lú-ia, E u o u a e. Lau¬</l><l xml:id="m-3f43f89c-2405-48e5-a22f-ce584942a110" facs="#m-efd1010f-904c-4c4e-8787-b6440e413770" label="lyrics-like">tem * aspéctus é-jus sic-ut fúl-gur: vestiménta é-jus sic</l><l xml:id="m-063a4af5-407b-4d81-9406-de5ea4e13234" facs="#m-bc0bf108-f0e8-4c61-b882-85c0f7e839a3" label="ambiguous">7. a.</l><l xml:id="m-045d4f17-eba1-4518-9f5c-bf92fdf2b7fa" facs="#m-bd0bbef7-f38b-4d2d-ad00-af800e00a1c7" label="ambiguous">P Rae t¬</l><l xml:id="m-ab60eece-e769-401e-8164-9f12a7caf0be" facs="#m-a87e1a12-b99f-4701-83c6-c919f6ec312f" label="lyrics-like">ut nix, alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-1982d3a6-84e2-4306-86c9-89f56e568ac1" facs="#m-af0ab765-974b-42ed-a08d-fa42255155cb" label="lyrics-like">mó-re autem éjus“ extérri-ti sunt custódes, et fácti sur</l></lg>
